## Tabler Icons

The toolbar iconography. Unlike AvalonEdit, this is not referenced as a package — the outline set's
path geometry is copied directly into `MDEdit/Resources/ToolbarIcons.xaml`, so the icons are
redistributed in both the source repository and the installed application.

<https://tabler.io/icons>

