## Not redistributed

The .NET 10 Desktop Runtime and WPF are **prerequisites**, not bundled components — MDEdit's
deployment is framework-dependent (`SelfContained=false`), so the runtime is installed separately by
the user and nothing of it is redistributed here. No notice is required for it.
